      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The authors propose a method of treatment of humeroscapular periarthritis by high conduction blocks of the brachial plexus by supraclavicular approach. The influence of high conduction blocks of the brachial plexus on the peripheral circulation in the upper extremities has been studied. The results of the treatment of 192 patients with humeroscapular periarthritis (mostly) with neglected forms of the disease) are presented."},
